# Dockerfile-specific ignore file: BuildKit uses this INSTEAD of .dockerignore
# when building Dockerfile.qlane, and leaves upstream's file untouched.
#
# Upstream's .dockerignore is written for a Dockerfile that copies a prebuilt
# binary, so it can afford to strip anything. It excludes **/.gitignore, which a
# from-source build cannot survive: the frontend build uses frontend/.gitignore
# as its eslint ignore path and fails with ENOENT without it.
**/node_modules
.git
frontend/dist
frontend/email-builder/dist
frontend/public/static/email-builder
listmonk
